abstract: >-
  One record per person, place, work, institution, event, and practice in Black
  culture — Chicago first. Version 2.2 (2026-11-18) is the verified-only
  release of the CultureTechLens combined graph (Release 2026-11-15), published
  under Phase 0 as amended (Amendment A1): only rows graded VERIFIED or STRONG
  EVIDENCE as stored are included — 3,488 entities, 2,628
  relationships, 491 preserved disagreements disclosed, and 205
  rights-documented photographs with per-image evidence records. Version 2.1
  (2026-10-30) remains published as a dated historical version.
keywords:
  - Black culture
  - Chicago
  - knowledge graph
  - cultural heritage
  - dataset
